{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "027yuk_306_2_3_027_06_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:339d10755f01c780ecb4f78306d3c4c323e4b829285ecf773e4239f79c1a4306",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_306_2_3_027_06_09_a:2_3_027_06_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4cd92d81277edb35dcd432a13b8693050d9fd6dcab16cde00cb383c625381061",
      "text": "喂喂？\n●●●●プロデューサー，能听我说说吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_306_2_3_027_06_09_a:2_3_027_06_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e40d653c941e8b553edbe230ef1d0559e773dec7b49c7357b7bdb21ac632485",
      "text": "今天来Cafe Parade的客人里，\n有一位时装模特呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_306_2_3_027_06_09_a:2_3_027_06_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bbde021cabc1d675d4b7f6991a859f1c3449fef802c8ce21cdac4f83a61b894",
      "text": "听说在世界各地都很活跃，\n跟我聊了好多有趣的事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_306_2_3_027_06_09_a:2_3_027_06_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8425f4f490fb2fc321e976135db0c4c03edc3710ef0f1e265cb19f16e4795ee1",
      "text": "他说在巴黎和纽约，遇到了许多\n极具个性的模特。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_306_2_3_027_06_09_a:2_3_027_06_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bf6bb2c35efca0d2496e969effd35651e0f1dbb42754bfbd843ba3093bbf253",
      "text": "说是那些人一旦走上T台，\n就会让人移不开目光。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_306_2_3_027_06_09_a:2_3_027_06_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81a5bd3f18827adfd77bb216afc9503713fe79f1131bb9ccbf79ba2cd7593801",
      "text": "我问了问原因，原来那些极具个性的\n模特们也有共同点呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_306_2_3_027_06_09_a:2_3_027_06_09_a:cmd-000018:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74d2c517a4c7a3d535ebf8c41de3639a94c8bdcba9ebee8bce684538f29337fe",
      "text": "共同点到底\n是什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_306_2_3_027_06_09_a:2_3_027_06_09_a:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6b6d0c5ccb9def1749451ddcbf6e0b8715b9fd1f4347f3d689ee64133301124",
      "text": "好好奇啊，\n请务必讲讲",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_306_2_3_027_06_09_a:2_3_027_06_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ce1bbd1548215a32f8ad4b3e3ff2ffd157fcf287dce6c6cad6d47f40c8fe189",
      "text": "据说是“深爱着服装”。\n仔细一想确实很有道理呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_306_2_3_027_06_09_a:2_3_027_06_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2caaf28b6b865c2fba15e2e06576ba39289bb25856d67be2d6b5be0068cc1cf1",
      "text": "我也打算带着这种意识去尝试模特工作。那么，明天事务所见。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
